            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>What was the nature of the CPD activity, practice-related feedback and/or event and/or experience in your practice? The CPD article outlined the differences between care plans and care planning. It discussed various nursing theories, tools and models, and how these may be applied to care planning to enhance patient-centred care.</AbstractText>
